,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1586125/cfae074d-166e-497d-965f-3f0459eb4640.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1586125/cfae074d-166e-497d-965f-3f0459eb4640.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Stunning Apartment in Wustermark-Elstal! 🌟🏡\n🏡 Apartment Overview\nWelcome to this spacious and modern apartment located in the charming town of Wustermark-Elstal. Designed for comfort and convenience, the apartment features a fully equipped kitchen with a dishwasher and microwave, a cozy living space with a flat-screen TV, and two well-appointed bathrooms with showers. Towels and bed linen are provided, ensuring a hassle-free stay. Enjoy the added benefits of a washing machine and free WiFi to meet your daily needs.\n\n🛋️ Comfortable Living Spaces\nThe apartment offers a bright and inviting bedroom, perfect for relaxation after a long day. With plenty of room to unwind, this space ensures a restful and serene atmosphere. The thoughtful layout and modern furnishings make it ideal for short or long stays.\n\n🌳 Outdoor Features\nStep outside to the garden and terrace, where you can enjoy fresh air and serene surroundings. Whether you're relaxing with a book or enjoying a quiet meal outdoors, these spaces add a touch of tranquility to your stay.\n\n📍 Prime Location\nSituated just 20 km from Sanssouci Palace and 22 km from Messe Berlin, this apartment provides easy access to some of the region's most iconic attractions. Local transportation options, including Elstal train station (1.9 km away), ensure seamless connectivity to nearby areas, including Berlin. For dining and leisure, Starbucks is a quick 250-meter stroll, while McDonald's and Cocos restaurant are within a short walking distance.\n\n🚗 Additional Features\nEnjoy the convenience of free private parking and full-day security, providing peace of mind during your stay. The property’s non-smoking policy ensures a clean and pleasant environment for all guests.\n\n💬 Get in Touch\nDon’t miss out on making this modern apartment your home away from home in Wustermark-Elstal! 🌟📩 Send a message today to learn more and start planning your stay.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"shared"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"180"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":500000,"deposit":100000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"5000.00","deposit":"1000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"2028-01-25","from":"2026-05-31"},{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2028-02-26"}],"updated":"2026-05-31T04:35:50Z","__utId__":"ut1586125"}]